### Test promotion with usage count
### Get promotion by ID (should show usedCount and remainingCount)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get promotion by code (should show usedCount and remainingCount)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/code/SUMMER2024
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get all promotions (should show usedCount and remainingCount for each)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Filter promotions with pagination (should show usedCount and remainingCount)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/filter?page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active",
  "promotionType": "coupon"
}

###

### Get all current promotions - New endpoint (should show usedCount and remainingCount)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/current
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get all current promotions - Old endpoint (should show usedCount and remainingCount)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/current-promotions
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Expected Response Format:
### {
###   "id": 1,
###   "code": "SUMMER2024",
###   "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
###   "promotionType": "coupon",
###   "discountValue": 20.00,
###   "minOrderValue": 100000.00,
###   "startDate": "2024-01-01",
###   "endDate": "2024-12-31",
###   "usageLimit": 100,           // Tổng số voucher có thể sử dụng
###   "usedCount": 35,              // Số voucher đã sử dụng
###   "remainingCount": 65,         // Số voucher còn lại (usageLimit - usedCount)
###   "status": "active",
###   "priority": 1,
###   "campaignId": null,
###   "conditions": []
### }
